EmmcpClientExamples=Connect a client
EmmcpRecommended=Recommended
EmmcpClientClaudeAi=Claude.ai (custom connector)
EmmcpConnectorOAuthHelp=In claude.ai: Settings → Connectors → "Add custom connector", then enter the URL below. Claude automatically discovers OAuth authentication, signs you in with your Dolibarr account and asks for your consent — no key to copy.
EmmcpConnectorUrlLabel=Connector URL
EmmcpClientClaudeCode=Claude Code
EmmcpAuthNote=API key authentication: "Authorization: Bearer <API key>" header (recommended) or "DOLAPIKEY: <API key>" header.
EmmcpCommandLabel=Command
EmmcpClientGeneric=Generic MCP client (mcp.json)
EmmcpYourApiKey=YOUR_API_KEY
EmmcpApiKeyHelp=A user's API key is generated on their card: Users & Groups → user card → "API key" tab. The user must have the permissions matching the expected actions, since the agent acts with their rights.

