EmmcpOAuthConsentTitle=Authorize access to Dolibarr
EmmcpOAuthConsentIntro=The application %s is requesting permission to access your Dolibarr with your account %s.
EmmcpOAuthConsentScope1=Read and manage the data your account has access to (third parties, invoices, products, documents…)
EmmcpOAuthConsentScope2=Act through the REST API with your Dolibarr permissions — nothing more than what you can already do
EmmcpOAuthAccept=Authorize
EmmcpOAuthDeny=Deny

